--- a/Changes
+++ b/Changes
@@ -1,5 +1,10 @@
 Revision history for Perl extension Class-XSAccessor.
 
+XPerl repair
+  - Disable the entersub fast path on XPerl reference-counted stacks.
+    Use normal XSUB dispatch to preserve argument and result ownership.
+  - Test repeated hash and array calls, warnings, and invocant destruction.
+
 1.19  Fri Nov 22 07:15 2013
   - Remove the OP tree munging optimization since it wasn't in the
     end really speeding things up. (chocolateboy)
--- a/MANIFEST
